<view class="page"><view class="card section"><text class="title">云端能力</text><text class="help">正式发布时需将域名加入微信公众平台 request 合法域名。未配置时，对弈使用本地规则引擎，AI 对话提供基础规则建议。</text><text class="label">Pikafish 引擎服务</text><input value="{{engineUrl}}" bindinput="engineInput" placeholder="https://api.example.com/engine"/><text class="label">AI 分析服务</text><input value="{{advisorUrl}}" bindinput="advisorInput" placeholder="https://api.example.com/advisor"/><button class="primary" bindtap="save">保存配置</button></view><view class="card section"><text class="title">跨端功能同步</text><view wx:for="{{features}}" wx:key="id" class="feature"><view><text>{{item.name}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.roadmap}}" class="roadmap">{{item.roadmap}}</text></view><text class="state {{item.miniprogram?'done':'pending'}}">{{item.miniprogram?'已同步':'迁移中'}}</text></view><text class="fingerprint">配置指纹 {{fingerprint}}</text></view></view>
